<title>MEXICO: Mexico to free milk prices in '98, confirms hikes.</title>
<headline>Mexico to free milk prices in '98, confirms hikes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Trade Ministry said Thursday it plans to free milk from price controls in 1998 and confirmed reports that corn pancake tortillas and pasteurised milk prices will be increased on December 30.</p>
<p>In statements, the ministry said tortillas will be raised to 1.70 peso per kilo from 1.40 peso and that one liter presentations of pasteurised milk will be raised to 4.00 pesos from 3.60 pesos.</p>
</text>
